OL,3,GNEWSA'Tears of joy' as under-threat
OL,4,Amusic studio is saved
OL,5,
OL,6,FLancashire musicians have said they are
OL,7,F"chuffed to bits" to hear a much-loved
OL,8,Fmusic studio will re-open after being
OL,9,Fclosed for six years.
OL,11,FLancaster Music Co-op's building on
OL,12,FLodge Street was forced to close in
OL,13,F2021 after it was was declared unsafe.
OL,15,FThis week they got the final #100,000
OL,16,Fneeded to finish refurbishments so the
OL,17,Fvenue can re-open next year.
OL,19,FMatt Sheffield, from the Alsatian Eyes
OL,20,Fband, said the four-piece post-punk
OL,21,Foutfit's "tears of glum fear have been
OL,22,Freplaced by tears of joy" at the news.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
